OpenPopSCR <https://github.com/benaug/OpenPopSCR> sounds like a good solution if it covers Ujjwal's case. Your point about MLE is well-taken, but I suspect the threshold of intractability is further out. The discrete random effect implied by a 2-part mixture model is easy to fit except for potential multimodality (I wonder if MCMC is completely robust to that). And sometimes sex differences are not as important as you might think.
Murray

